# Class: obo:FOODON_00001071 (grape must)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00001071 "A grape berry food product which is the juice of freshly pressed grapes that contains some amount of pulp, skins, stems, and seeds."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:FOODON_00001071 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Must#Winemaking>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_00001071 "Grape pomace components typically comprises between 7 to 23 percent of the total weight of must. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Must]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_00001071 "grape must"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:FOODON_00001071 obo:FOODON_00001162)

# Class: obo:FOODON_00001211 (pasta food product)

