AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_00002607 "Semillon wine is a white wine varietal produced only from Semillon grapes.  The primary fruit flavors in Semillon wine are lemon, apple, pear and green papaya. Semillon is France’s 3rd most planted white wine variety behind Sauvignon Blanc and Chardonnay."@en)
